data: {"id": "a7495783e91744f4-final", "run_id": "a7495783e91744f4", "seq": 580, "ts_ms": 1788474540583, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` | CrashLoopBackOff | Container 'app' OOMKilled due to memory usage exceeding the 96Mi limit, leading to CrashLoopBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning  BackOff    3m42s (x495 over 134m)  kubelet  Back-off restarting failed container app` | 核心症状证据，表明容器正在被 Kubernetes 反复重启并进入退避策略。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `Exit Code: 137` (Container `app`) | 决定性的状态证据，Exit Code 137 明确表示容器进程被信号 9 (SIGKILL) 终止，符合 OOM Kill 特征。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory`: `96Mi` (Container `app`) | 故障边界证据，指明了容器内存使用的硬限制，为内存溢出结论提供阈值依据。 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `Liveness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 500` | 现象佐证，解释了为什么在容器重启间隙 Liveness 探针会失败，导致 Pod 判定为不健康。 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` = `Error` (Container `app`) | 独立观测，确认容器最后一次终止原因是 Error，与 K8s Event 和 Exit Code 相互印证。 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = `45` (Container `app`) | 量化指标，与 Event 中的 45 次重启统计一致，确认故障的持续性和频度。 |\n| 7 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `request completed` (HTTP 200, path: `/work`) 观察窗口: `22:23:03` 至 `22:23:32` (8次) | 限定性证据，展示了故障爆发前的服务可用状态及未发生异常的请求模式。 |\n| 8 | Tracing | Tempo/Deepflow | `GET /work` (HTTP 200) trace_id: `dbc93c3...` | 关联验证，确认了该业务流量在崩溃发生前或间歇期的正常响应链路。 |\n\n证据逻辑说明：\nExit Code 137 结合 `resource_limit.memory: 96Mi` 和 `BackOff` 事件，构成了内存溢出导致容器崩溃的完整证据链。Metric 的 `Error` 终止原因与 K8s 状态一致。Logging 和 Tracing 展示了崩溃前后的正常 HTTP 流量，证明故障表现为突发性的资源耗尽而非持续性代码逻辑错误。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用内存使用突破 96Mi 硬限制 → Linux OOM Killer 强制终止进程 (Exit Code 137) → 容器启动失败且 Liveness 探针返回 500 → Pod 触发 BackOff 机制进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为容器 `app` 的内存使用量超过了配置的 **96Mi** 硬限制。\n\n1. **故障机制验证**：容器 `app` 被 Linux OOM Killer 终止（**事实 #2**, 退出码 137）。\n2. **故障边界**：容器的内存硬限制配置为 **96Mi**（**事实 #3**），这是导致被终止的直接阈值。\n3. **故障现象**：由于进程被终止，Kubernetes 频繁重启容器，最终触发 `BackOff` 机制进入 **CrashLoopBackOff** 状态（**事实 #1**, **事实 #4**）。\n4. **数据一致性**：Metric 数据证实容器最后终止原因为 `Error`（**事实 #5**），重启总数为 45 次（**事实 #6**），与 K8s 事件完全吻合。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 45.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc: 45.2s (Evidence 37.2s, RCA 7.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 80.76, "metrics": {"run_id": "a7495783e91744f4", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 80.77295136451721, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 80772.95136451721, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 60673.508405685425, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 42230.91793060303, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 19573.11964035034}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22739.75968360901, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 45190.19889831543, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12809.064626693726, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

